LOCATION:Historic Blakeley State Park\, 34745 St. Hwy 225 / American Patrio
 ts Way\, Spanish Fort\, AL 36527
DESCRIPTION:Friday 11/13 · 2:15 PM and 4:00 PM cruises\n\nHistoric Blakele
 y State Park runs a Mobile Harbor cruise guided by maritime historian John
  Sledge. The 90-minute outing passes the USS Enterprise and is billed as a
  sunset trip. Two departures run that afternoon.\n\nPrice: from $25\n\nDet
 ails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blakeley-mobile-harbor-cruise
 -1113.html
