SUMMARY:ECOKids day at From the Ground Up Community Garden
LOCATION:From the Ground Up Community Garden\, 200 E La Rua St\, Pensacola\
 , FL 32501
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 11/14 · 10:00 AM to 2:00 PM\n\nFrom the Ground Up Com
 munity Garden hosts ECOKids\, a free morning and early afternoon of nature
  learning for children. A play called Old Plastic\, New Rules runs from 10
  AM to 11 AM\, followed by a relay of learning stations from 11 AM to 1 PM
  run by groups such as Dune Defenders\, Keep Pensacola Beautiful and the N
 avarre Beach Sea Turtle Conservation Center. Local kid musicians play from
  1 PM to 2 PM. Admission is free.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: https://coast
 aleventures.com/events/ev-ecokids-from-the-ground-up-garden-1114.html
